The UI/UX and accessibility review for **TrustShield AI** (`feature/auth-supabase-history-uiux`) is complete. All findings have been compiled into [antigravity_uiux_review.md](file:///C:/Users/shubh/trustshield-ai/docs/security-runs/antigravity_uiux_review.md).

No source code files were modified.

